###
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
  "text": "什么是JVM"
}

### 2. 测试 ik_max_word（最细粒度，存索引用）
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_max_word",
  "text": "JVM的数据库"
}

### 3. 测试 ik_smart（智能粒度，搜索用）
POST http://localhost:9200/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "ik_smart",
  "text": "JVM的内存结构"
}

### 1. 查询所有数据（验证是不是有 2 条）
GET http://localhost:9200/question/_search?pretty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match_all": {}
  }
}

### 2. 用 match 查标题含“虚拟机”
GET http://localhost:9200/question/_search?pretty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "content": "虚拟机"
    }
  }
}

### 3. 用 term 查标签包含 "Java"
GET http://localhost:9200/question/_search?pretty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "term": {
      "tags": "Java"
    }
  }
}

